"tool_execution_end":95,"tool_execution_start":95,"tool_execution_update":168,"turn_end":96,"turn_start":96},"tool_executions":95,"invalid_jsonl_lines":0,"final_assistant_text":"Implemented a conditional, accessible \u201cjump\u201d action in the Void browser crumb (`\u2299`) that now appears **when a track is playing but its row is not currently visible in the browser\u2019s scroll viewport**\u2014including when the track\u2019s **parent folder is already the current browser folder**. When tapped, it keeps the browser in that folder and scrolls the playing row into view. The action is **not shown when no track is playing**.\n\n### What changed\n- `lib/widgets/void_browser.dart`\n  - Added `VoidBrowserController.isTrackVisible(path)` which checks whether the row\u2019s `GlobalKey` context intersects the browser\u2019s scroll viewport.\n- `lib/screens/void_screen.dart`\n  - Updated the crumb\u2019s `\u2299` visibility condition to show when the playing track is not visible (not just when it\u2019s in another folder).\n  - Updated semantics label to \u201cjump to now-playing track\u201d.\n\n### Screenshots (Linux)\nScenario used: Linux desktop, `emulate tiny`, playing `/opt/nothingness/media/07-undercover-44.opus`, where the row starts outside the visible browser region.\n\n- **Before (row offscreen; action visible)**  \n  `.tmp/agent_shots/feat44_before.png`\n- **After (action activated; playing row scrolled into view)**  \n  `.tmp/agent_shots/feat44_after.png`","final_stop_reason":"stop","stop_reasons":{"completed":96},"truncated_turns":0,"final_error":null,"usage":{"aggregate":{"tokens":{"input":111709,"output":26772,"reasoning":17826,"cacheRead":5080576,"cacheWrite":0,"total":5219057},"cost_usd":{"total":0.15741832,"breakdown":{"input":0.022341800000000002,"output":0.033464999999999995,"cacheRead":0.10161152000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.15741832}},"cost_missing":false},"final":{"tokens":{"input":195,"output":298,"reasoning":10,"cacheRead":78592,"cacheWrite":0